hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"201","When you sneeze , then say: ¤ ¤ Alḥamdulillāh ¤ ¤ Your companion should say: ¤ ¤ Yarḥamukallāh ¤ ¤ to you then you should say: ¤ ¤ Yahdīkumullāhu wa yuṣliḥu bālakum. ¤ ¤ When you sneeze, then say: All praises and thanks are to Allah. ¤ ¤ Your companion should say: May Allah have mercy upon you. ¤ ¤ When someone says Yarḥamukallāh to you then you should say: May Allah guide you and set your affairs in order. ¤ ¤ Yahdīkumullāhu wa yuṣliḥu bālakum. ¤ ¤ May Allah guide you and set your affairs in order."
